# RoyalRushAfflict (18244), a watchman of the graves, and RoyalRushTrasureBox (18256),
# Halisha's treasure box. Created on a draw of 0, each looks around and wants to follow the
# character it sees (a draw under 50). A hit makes the watchman want to flee the character
# by its drift range (200), with no hate; the box, which cannot move, hates no one and adds
# no flee. Their timed paths read the local clock, which deletes them at minute 54, so they
# are covered by tests/ai/royal_rush_afflict_test.go, which sets the clock.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.RoyalRushDefaultNpc.RoyalRushAfflict
script script.ai.individual.RoyalRushDefaultNpc.RoyalRushDefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.RoyalRushDefaultNpc.RoyalRushTrasureBox
npc bomb 18244 Monster 100 0 0 walks skill AFFLICT_SKILL1 4614 9
npc box 18256 HalishaChest -100 0 0

hit bomb 10
  hate bomb 0
  desires bomb follow(player)=100 flee(player,200)=100

hit box 10
  hate box 0
  desires box follow(player)=100
